Configure the operator's verified HTTPS broker origin

Usage:
  mcp-runtime credential configure [flags]

Flags:
      --aws-role-arn string          EKS workload identity role ARN (cloud IAM federation must already be configured)
      --azure-client-id string       Azure workload identity client UUID (cloud federation must already be configured)
      --broker-url string            Public HTTPS platform origin trusted by gateway system roots
      --context string               Explicit Kubernetes context
      --gcp-service-account string   GKE workload identity service-account email (cloud IAM federation must already be configured)
  -h, --help                         help for configure
      --kubeconfig string            Explicit kubeconfig path
      --vault-role string            Vault Kubernetes auth role bound to the platform API service account and mcp-runtime-vault audience
      --vault-url string             Optional verified HTTPS Vault origin for Kubernetes workload authentication
      --yes                          Confirm the operator configuration change

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
